                                                "sense_id": "ecbd66b6-f675-3106-9104-54ea12759622",
                                                "text": "A dirty package was left in my home."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "665d5c7c-c9af-356f-a35d-db9095416145",
                                        "entry_id": "4fd52538-9304-3ec4-9260-d1d9f79a9306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which consists of various components, such as a piece of computer software."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2d1c535-76ea-4e7d-b9cf-154de300e7d3",
                                                "sense_id": "665d5c7c-c9af-356f-a35d-db9095416145",
                                                "text": "Did you test the software package to ensure completeness?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aca1696b-abec-4a12-b40e-1f3d782a2d36",
                                                "sense_id": "665d5c7c-c9af-356f-a35d-db9095416145",
                                                "text": "It’s now created a system where creators should be afraid to make a series that dares to end on a cliffhanger or save anything for future seasons, lest their story forever be left unfinished. And viewers are afraid to commit to any show that isn’t a completely aired package lest they spend 10-30 hours on something that ends up unresolved, which has happened dozens and dozens of times, creating a vast “show graveyard” within Netflix."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "900cef2e-7938-3370-ab8c-374442e02dc7",
                                        "entry_id": "4fd52538-9304-3ec4-9260-d1d9f79a9306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of software which has been prepared in such a way that it can be installed with a package manager."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff2662b9-ea88-3f51-8e7d-585d6c301dfd",
                                        "entry_id": "4fd52538-9304-3ec4-9260-d1d9f79a9306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of packing something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7e1cbbd-c3fc-4611-8be1-f63742cbd892",
                                                "sense_id": "ff2662b9-ea88-3f51-8e7d-585d6c301dfd",
                                                "text": "for, it has often happened that, without any accident at ſea, heavy averages, owing to bad package and ſtowage only, have been demanded, and paid by inſurers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ba50c58-94d3-4dd4-b2cf-7384298d3297",
                                                "sense_id": "ff2662b9-ea88-3f51-8e7d-585d6c301dfd",
                                                "text": "The Company's instructions to the supracargoes of their ships are very particular as to the mode of package and stowage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d30b673-b580-43c0-905c-8fd81dc08244",
                                                "sense_id": "ff2662b9-ea88-3f51-8e7d-585d6c301dfd",
                                                "text": "But we see more; we see a very curious and artificial arrangement of the fibres very much contributing to facilitate their package, and by which they mutually support one another and act with the greatest advantage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "522286d5-b9ee-3404-9a9c-6be6243397f1",
                                        "entry_id": "4fd52538-9304-3ec4-9260-d1d9f79a9306",
